- USER JOURNEYS
==================

JOURNEY 1 - CALCULATE A TRIP'S GAS COST
---------------------------------------
User:              Road-tripper
Goal:              Find out what a trip will cost in gas before leaving
Entry point:       Home
Decision points:   Pick a saved vehicle or choose a new one;
                   one way or round trip; save the trip or not
Page sequence:     Home > Calculate Trip > Trip Results
Success:           The total gas cost for the trip is shown
Potential friction: No vehicle saved yet; unsure if the gas price is
                   current


JOURNEY 2 - SET UP MY CAR AND CHECK MY COMMUTE
----------------------------------------------
User:              Daily commuter
Goal:              Save their car and see what their daily commute costs
Entry point:       Home
Decision points:   Sign in or create an account; pick make, model and
                   year; choose which saved trip to open
Page sequence:     Home > Account > Sign In / Sign Up > My Garage >
                   Add Vehicle > Saved Trips > Trip Results
Success:           The commute cost is shown using their own car
Potential friction: Doesn't know the exact model or year; signing up
                   feels like an extra step before seeing a cost